# TMDB artwork: "direct" (default) loads pre-sized images straight from the TMDB CDN; "optimized" routes them
# through the Next.js image optimizer (smaller AVIF/WebP, but a server-side fetch with a fixed 7s limit).
NEXT_PUBLIC_TMDB_IMAGE_MODE="direct"
